# Packages

Every package the binary carries, with its extensions, its modules and what
each module declares. A **package** is the distribution unit, an
**extension** the implementation unit, and a **module** the canonical HQL
name, a contract bound to one provider: the runtime, or exactly one extension
([HQL-0024, modules](../proposals/HQL-0024/parts/01-modules.md), "Three
identities"). One extension provides any number of modules; one package
carries any number of modules and extensions.

The binary carries its builtin packages under `lib/`, one folder each,
provisioned as builtin: their contracts are bundled with the binary and their
extensions compiled into it. It carries one so far, `std`, the standard package ([std README](../../lib/std/README.md)). Its root holds `prelude.hql`, the
package's global space, and one folder per module.

| Package | Provisioned | Extensions | Modules | Types | Traits |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `std` | builtin: contracts bundled, extensions compiled in | 14, of which 12 provide a module with a contract | 18: 13 provided by an extension, 5 by the runtime | 101 | 14 |

## Extensions

Which modules each extension's descriptor provides, as
`src/extensions/mod.rs` declares them. A module no extension provides is
implemented by the runtime: every declaration in it has an HQL body, or it
declares types alone.

| Extension | Provides | Contract |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `core` | `core`, `collections` | `lib/std/core`, `lib/std/collections` |
| `string` | `string` | `lib/std/string` |
| `seq` | `seq` | `lib/std/seq` |
| `math` | `math` | `lib/std/math` |
| `option` | `option` | `lib/std/option` |
| `result` | `result` | `lib/std/result` |
| `regex` | `regex` | `lib/std/regex` |
| `graph` | `graph` | `lib/std/graph` |
| `format` | `format` | `lib/std/format` |
| `io` | `io` | `lib/std/io` |
| `net` | `io.net` | `lib/std/io/net` |
| `logging` | `io.logging` | `lib/std/io/logging` |
| `lexical` | `lexical` | none: no contract under `lib/std/` declares the module |
| `semantic` | `semantic` | none: no contract under `lib/std/` declares the module |

## Modules

Each module of `std`, in import order: its provider, the modules it imports,
its receiver pattern if it is a receiver module, the types and traits it
declares, its constructors, how many operation names it declares, and how
many `impl` headers it writes. Read from each module's `mod.hql` on
2026-10-23; a document reads only files under its own directory, so the table
is regenerated by hand when a module changes.

| Module | Provider | Imports | Receiver | Types | Traits | Constructors | Operations | Impls |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `core` | `core` | — | — | `Orderable`, `Scalar`, `Bool`, `Int`, `Float`, `Decimal`, `String`, `Date`, `Iterable`, `Collection`, `Stream`, `Seq`, `List`, `Set`, `Map`, `OrderedMap`, `SortedMap`, `Data`, `TypeContract`, `DataContract`, `Option`, `Result`, `Ordering`, `Type`, `Format`, `Is`, `Range`, `Operation`, `Elementwise`, `Partition`, `Reduction`, `Barrier`, `Pair`, `Violation`, `Invalid` | `Eq`, `Ord`, `Add`, `Sub`, `Mul`, `Div`, `Rem`, `Index`, `Slice`, `Validator` | `List`, `Set`, `Map`, `OrderedMap`, `SortedMap`, `Data` | 0 | 32 |
| `doc` | runtime | `core` | — | `Doc`, `HmdHeader`, `HmdDoc`, `Card`, `HmdCard`, `MdCard` | — | — | 0 | 0 |
| `retrieval` | runtime | `core` | — | `Hit`, `Ranking` | — | — | 0 | 0 |
| `graph` | `graph` | `core`, `doc`, `retrieval` | — | `Edge`, `Graph`, `Link`, `HmdGraph` | — | `Graph` | 0 | 0 |
| `knowledge` | runtime | `core`, `doc`, `graph` | — | `Concept`, `Proposition`, `Evidence`, `Knowledge`, `Relation`, `ConceptCard`, `RelationCard`, `KnowledgeGraph` | — | — | 0 | 0 |
| `collections` | `core` | `core`, `doc` | — | `Group` | — | — | 40 | 0 |
| `string` | `string` | `core` | `String` | — | — | — | 44 | 0 |
| `seq` | `seq` | `core` | `Seq<T>` | — | — | — | 26 | 0 |
| `math` | `math` | `core` | — | — | — | — | 17 | 0 |
| `option` | `option` | `core` | `Option<T>` | — | — | — | 7 | 0 |
| `result` | `result` | `core` | `Result<T, E>` | — | — | — | 9 | 0 |
| `regex` | `regex` | `core` | — | — | — | — | 7 | 0 |
| `format` | `format` | `core`, `graph` | — | `Text`, `Lines`, `Hql`, `Markdown`, `Hmd`, `Json`, `JsonLines`, `Yaml`, `Csv`, `D2`, `Mermaid`, `Table` | `Decoder`, `Encoder` | `Table` | 12 | 22 |
